                                                "sense_id": "7308512c-44e2-30cc-b0ca-c5c7d738f290",
                                                "text": "Sword. — The blade is straight, tapers gradually, is 32 9/16 inches long from shoulder to point, and is fullered on both sides, commencing 2 inches from the shoulder, to about 17 inches from the point, to a thickness of ·035 inch."
